# spring-webmvc 6.2.19: the fix exists only in Spring Framework 7.0.9; 6.2.x is out of open-source maintenance (19 is the last release), and Spring Boot 3.5 is built on 6.2.
# Not exploitable here: the services return JSON through @RestController only. There is no XsltView, no view resolver and no server-sent events endpoint.
# Real fix: move to Spring Boot 4 (backlog, post-1.0).
